{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_B4E79E78","title":"It's Miso!","entry":"Dlg_B4E79E78::entry","exit":"Dlg_B4E79E78::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_ADEF1AE4","articyId":"72057821671313356","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salma Smith","text":"There you are! I don’t know how I’m ever going to thank you. How WE can ever thank you.","speakerId":"Ntt_A7B3062F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"There you are! I don’t know how I’m ever going to thank you. How WE can ever thank you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":600.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35023","byteOffset":25609960,"byteLength":400}},{"id":"DFr_4EB0DE4D","articyId":"72057821671313368","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salma Smith","text":"Seth. I couldn't believe it. I would have walked right past, but what you said made me look and then under that hood, under all those scars, I saw him. My Seth.","speakerId":"Ntt_A7B3062F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Seth. I couldn't believe it. I would have walked right past, but what you said made me look and then under that hood, under all those scars, I saw him. My Seth.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39053","byteOffset":29107368,"byteLength":504}},{"id":"DFr_5ED7998A","articyId":"72057821671313382","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salma Smith","text":"No. Not yet. Well, he says he remembers something, an image of his birthday and the cake I made him, but he might just be saying that to make me feel better.","speakerId":"Ntt_A7B3062F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No. Not yet. Well, he says he remembers something, an image of his birthday and the cake I made him, but he might just be saying that to make me feel better.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1811.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39170","byteOffset":29151728,"byteLength":468}},{"id":"DFr_25AB04A7","articyId":"72057821671313396","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salma Smith","text":"I know. But it doesn’t matter. We’ve found each other now. We’ll make new memories.","speakerId":"Ntt_A7B3062F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I know. But it doesn’t matter. We’ve found each other now. We’ll make new memories.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17440","byteOffset":14486184,"byteLength":400}},{"id":"DFr_02A923B7","articyId":"72057821671313410","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salma Smith","text":"You've done more than help. You've given me back my little brother. Even if he doesn't remember me.","speakerId":"Ntt_A7B3062F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You've done more than help. You've given me back my little brother. Even if he doesn't remember me.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1812.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48600","byteOffset":32722048,"byteLength":408}},{"id":"DFr_E57F911C","articyId":"72057821671313425","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salma Smith","text":"I’ll never be able to repay you. But you must come for dinner with us sometime. It’s the least I can do. We’ll go for ramen!","speakerId":"Ntt_A7B3062F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"T